<title>PAKISTAN: Knoll Pharmaceuticals net even.</title>
<headline>Knoll Pharmaceuticals net even.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		 708 vs 653</p>
<p>Profit before tax	169 vs 183</p>
<p>Profit after tax     118 vs 118</p>
<p>    Dividend	   100 pct vs 100 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Bonus stocks	nil vs  20 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Knoll Pharmaceuticals Ltd. Book closure August 29 to September 9. Annual general meeting will be held on September 9 at Karachi. Ex-dividend date August 29.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
